	<CK.About.Text>Colony Surname ZH 0.2.0
Chinese names plus acquaintance, event, kinship, and marriage relations.

Data: Mods/ColonySurnameZh/Data/Names/*.txt — edit the surname and given-name pools directly.
Settings: Names tab (chance/scope/nickname), Relations tab (per-relation switch, weight, opinion; sworn thresholds; godparent rules), Marriage tab (system, cap, primary/secondary labels, co-spouse, jealousy, favoritism).

Known limits: one bed per pawn, so extra spouses do not get extra beds; the vanilla social tab still uses the underlying husband/wife label, and primary/secondary labels are rewritten on the social relation rows.</CK.About.Text>

	<CK.Gizmo.AdoptGodparent>Take as godchild</CK.Gizmo.AdoptGodparent>
	<CK.Gizmo.AdoptGodparent.Desc>Choose an adult at least 16 years apart, not blood-related, with mutual opinion of 20 or more, and become their godparent.</CK.Gizmo.AdoptGodparent.Desc>
